</section><p>Thank you to every contributor, translator, tester, supporter, and community member who helped shape this release. Your bug reports, ideas, code, patience, and encouragement continue to make OpenShot better.</p><p>If OpenShot has helped you create, learn, teach, or share your story, please consider <a href="https://www.openshot.org/donate/">supporting the project</a>. Donations help fund development, infrastructure, testing, documentation, and future releases.</p>



